  "name": "sequence-step",
  "description": "One ordered step of a sequence (BO-F3-03): the days after the previous fire, the channel it sends on, and the approved template with personalization variables. Steps are append-only while the sequence is a draft; once the sequence is active a step is never edited, only skipped per enrollment, so a running person never sees a step change under them. (backlog:22bb154a72ea)",
